      "native": {
        "id": null,
        "value": {
          "attachment": "native_docstring",
          "attachment_identity": "python:ptcna:ptcna/core/exchange.py::<module>",
          "description": "An *exchange* is a single routing event that writes a weighted score\ninto one or more tensor cells.  The score is computed from:\n\n  score = DELTA * (\n      ALPHA * s1_weight\n    + BETA  * s2_weight\n    + GAMMA * s5_weight\n    + ALPHA * s8_weight\n    + bonus\n  )\n\nwhere the sentinel weights are normalised values supplied by the\ncaller (typically 0.0–1.0) representing signal strength on each\nchannel.\n\nThe module also provides seed aggregation (AGG_SEEDS) and S6 identity\naggregation (AGG6), both currently \"mean\".\n\nTypical usage\n-------------\n::\n\n    from ptcna.core.exchange import Exchange\n    from ptcna.core.tensor import PTCATensor\n    from ptcna.core.sentinels import SentinelState\n\n    tensor = PTCATensor()\n    state  = SentinelState()\n\n    exc = Exchange(tensor, state)\n    result = exc.route(\n        node=0, phase=0, slot=0,\n        s1=1.0, s2=0.5, s5=0.8, s8=0.1,\n    )",
          "fields": [],
          "format": "google",
          "metadata_kind": "documentation",
          "summary": "Exchange mechanics — weighted scoring across sentinel channels.",
          "text": "\nExchange mechanics — weighted scoring across sentinel channels.\n\nAn *exchange* is a single routing event that writes a weighted score\ninto one or more tensor cells.  The score is computed from:\n\n  score = DELTA * (\n      ALPHA * s1_weight\n    + BETA  * s2_weight\n    + GAMMA * s5_weight\n    + ALPHA * s8_weight\n    + bonus\n  )\n\nwhere the sentinel weights are normalised values supplied by the\ncaller (typically 0.0–1.0) representing signal strength on each\nchannel.\n\nThe module also provides seed aggregation (AGG_SEEDS) and S6 identity\naggregation (AGG6), both currently \"mean\".\n\nTypical usage\n-------------\n::\n\n    from ptcna.core.exchange import Exchange\n    from ptcna.core.tensor import PTCATensor\n    from ptcna.core.sentinels import SentinelState\n\n    tensor = PTCATensor()\n    state  = SentinelState()\n\n    exc = Exchange(tensor, state)\n    result = exc.route(\n        node=0, phase=0, slot=0,\n        s1=1.0, s2=0.5, s5=0.8, s8=0.1,\n    )\n"
        }
      },
