      "kind": "documentation",
      "native": {
        "id": null,
        "value": {
          "attachment": "native_docstring",
          "attachment_identity": "python:ptcna:ptcna/core/prime_core/core.py::<module>",
          "description": "This module no longer defines duplicate ``Circle`` or ``Seed`` classes.\n``ptcna.circle.CircleTensor`` owns circles and ``ptcna.seed.Seed`` owns seeds.\nThe core hosts those structural objects and remains non-differentiating.\n\nUsage:\n\n    from ptcna.core.prime_core import CoreSpec, build_core\n\n    core = build_core(CoreSpec(\n        seed_count=2,\n        circles_per_seed=2,\n        tensors_per_circle=2,\n        tensor_dim=3,\n    ))\n    assert core.requires_grad is False\n\nPass a ``payload_factory`` when neural-owned payload objects are required. The\nfactory owns their construction; PTCNA core composition carries them opaquely.",
          "fields": [],
          "format": "rest",
          "metadata_kind": "documentation",
          "summary": "Compose fiqs through the shared circle and seed layers into a core.",
          "text": "Compose fiqs through the shared circle and seed layers into a core.\n\nThis module no longer defines duplicate ``Circle`` or ``Seed`` classes.\n``ptcna.circle.CircleTensor`` owns circles and ``ptcna.seed.Seed`` owns seeds.\nThe core hosts those structural objects and remains non-differentiating.\n\nUsage:\n\n    from ptcna.core.prime_core import CoreSpec, build_core\n\n    core = build_core(CoreSpec(\n        seed_count=2,\n        circles_per_seed=2,\n        tensors_per_circle=2,\n        tensor_dim=3,\n    ))\n    assert core.requires_grad is False\n\nPass a ``payload_factory`` when neural-owned payload objects are required. The\nfactory owns their construction; PTCNA core composition carries them opaquely.\n"
        }
      },
