          "summary": "Vertex visitation order of the ``{n/step}`` star polygon.",
          "text": "Vertex visitation order of the ``{n/step}`` star polygon.\n\n    For ``n = 7``: ``step 2 -> [0,2,4,6,1,3,5]``; ``step 3 -> [0,3,6,2,5,1,4]``.\n    Requires ``gcd(step, n) == 1`` so every vertex is visited exactly once.\n    "
